{"speciesId":682,"names":{"fr":"Fluvetin","es":"Spritzee","en":"Spritzee","ja":"シュシュプ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps dégage un parfum qui envoûte ceux qui le respirent et change en fonction de son alimentation."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Su cuerpo emana una fragancia que embelesa a quien la huele. La fragancia es diferente según los alimentos que ingiere."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It emits a scent that enraptures those who smell it. This fragrance changes depending on what it has eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"かいだ 者を うっとりさせる 香りを 体から 漂わせる。 食べた もので 香りが 変わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Par le passé, les femmes de la noblesse ne se parfumaient pas, mais étaient accompagnées d’un Fluvetin exhalant leur parfum favori."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Antaño, las damas de la nobleza llevaban un Spritzee consigo que desprendía su aroma preferido, en vez de utilizar un perfume convencional."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"In the past, rather than using perfume, royal ladies carried a Spritzee that would waft a fragrance they liked."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"昔の 貴婦人たちは 香水の かわりに 好みの 香りを 出す シュシュプを 連れていたという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Son corps dégage un parfum qui envoûte ceux qui le respirent et change en fonction de son alimentation."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Su cuerpo emana una fragancia que embelesa a quien la huele. La fragancia es diferente según los alimentos que ingiere."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"It emits a scent that enraptures those who smell it. This fragrance changes depending on what it has eaten."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"かいだ 者を うっとりさせる 香りを 体から 漂わせる。 食べた もので 香りが 変わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Par le passé, les femmes de la noblesse ne se parfumaient pas, mais étaient accompagnées d’un Fluvetin exhalant leur parfum favori."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Antaño, las damas de la nobleza llevaban un Spritzee consigo que desprendía su aroma preferido, en vez de utilizar un perfume convencional."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"In the past, rather than using perfume, royal ladies carried a Spritzee that would waft a fragrance they liked."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"昔の 貴婦人たちは 香水の かわりに 好みの 香りを 出す シュシュプを 連れていたという。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Ce Pokémon sécrète son doux parfum grâce à un organe en forme de poche. S’il modifie son alimentation, l’odeur de son parfum change."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Posee un órgano interno con el cual produce una fragancia que varía en función de los alimentos que ingiere."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"A scent pouch within this Pokémon’s body allows it to create various scents. A change in its diet will alter the fragrance it produces."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"体内の におい袋で においを つくる ポケモン。 エサが 変わると つくられる においも 変わる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Une douce odeur qui charme les gens émane de son corps. Les dames nobles raffolaient de lui."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Su cuerpo emana una fragancia que embelesa a quien la huele. Llegó a ser muy apreciado entre las damas de la nobleza."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"The scent its body gives off enraptures those who smell it. Noble ladies had no shortage of love for Spritzee."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"人を 魅了する 香しい においを 体から 漂わせる。 高貴な 婦人たちに 愛された。"}],"varieties":[{"id":682,"moves":[{"name":"disable","learns":[[15,"egg",0],[16,"egg",0],[17,"egg",0],[18,"egg",0],[20,"egg",0]]},{"name":"thunderbolt","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0],[20,"machine",0]]},{"name":"toxic","learns":[[15,"machine",0],[16,"machine",0],[17,"machine",0],[18,"machine",0]]},{"name":"psychic","learns":[[15,"l